 ## Common checks
 
+On Tailscale Serve deployments, an existing `BB_TAILNET_IDENTITY_OWNED_HOST`
+automatically selects the installed Identity Boundaries provider. Do not add a
+second boundary opt-in unless custom ingress or another provider requires it.
+`bb settings p6r-identity --json` reports this CLI connection's identity; a local
+machine result does not prove that a person's browser resolves the same way.
